
graph TB

    classDef entrypoint fill:#f9f,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef triage fill:#bbf,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef specialized fill:#fbb,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef router fill:#ff9,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef destination fill:#bfb,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px;

    Ticket[Incoming Support Ticket]:::entrypoint

    Triage["<b>Triage Agent</b><br/><b>Model:</b> Haiku<br/><b>Tools:</b> Text Classifier, DB Lookup<br/><b>Handles:</b> Categorizes urgency, issue type, and customer tier"]:::triage

    Ticket --> Triage

    subgraph Parallel Specialized Agents
        Tech["<b>Technical Agent</b><br/><b>Model:</b> Sonnet<br/><b>Tools:</b> Log Analyzer, API Checker<br/><b>Handles:</b> Bugs, errors, system failures"]:::specialized
        
        Billing["<b>Billing Agent</b><br/><b>Model:</b> Haiku<br/><b>Tools:</b> Stripe API, Invoice Ledger<br/><b>Handles:</b> Refunds, subscriptions, payments"]:::specialized
        
        KB["<b>Knowledge Base Agent</b><br/><b>Model:</b> Haiku<br/><b>Tools:</b> Vector Search, Doc Retriever<br/><b>Handles:</b> FAQs, guides, account setup"]:::specialized
    end

    Triage --> Tech
    Triage --> Billing
    Triage --> KB

    Router["<b>Routing Agent</b><br/><b>Model:</b> Sonnet<br/><b>Tools:</b> Rule Engine, Evaluator<br/><b>Handles:</b> Synthesizes parallel analysis and decides final path"]:::router

    Tech --> Router
    Billing --> Router
    KB --> Router

    Auto["<b>Auto-response (~40%)</b><br/>Immediate automated resolution"]:::destination
    Human["<b>Human Team (~55%)</b><br/>Handled by support agents"]:::destination
    Escalation["<b>Escalation (~5%)</b><br/>Urgent/VIP management queue"]:::destination

    Router --> Auto
    Router --> Human
    Router --> Escalation